HB0140 Continuity of Permitting Act.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Filer, Haroldson and Wylie and
Senator(s) Barlow and Crago
AN ACT relating to cities and towns; requiring jurisdiction over pending
building permit or land use applications to remain with the county until the
applications are issued or denied; requiring jurisdiction to transfer to an
annexing city or town as specified; specifying applicability; and providing for
an effective date.
